{
  "contract_version": 1,
  "strategy": "replace",
  "on_drift": "fail",
  "mappings": [
    {
      "from": "skills/kb-search",
      "to": ".zcode/skills/kb-search"
    },
    {
      "from": "skills/kb-curate",
      "to": ".zcode/skills/kb-curate"
    },
    {
      "from": "skills/grilling",
      "to": ".zcode/skills/grilling"
    },
    {
      "from": "skills/ship",
      "to": ".zcode/skills/ship"
    },
    {
      "from": "skills/init",
      "to": ".zcode/skills/init"
    },
    {
      "from": "skills/doc",
      "to": ".zcode/skills/doc"
    },
    {
      "from": "skills/roles",
      "to": ".zcode/skills/roles"
    },
    {
      "from": "skills/to-tickets",
      "to": ".zcode/skills/to-tickets"
    },
    {
      "from": "skills/code-review",
      "to": ".zcode/skills/code-review"
    },
    {
      "from": "skills/architecture",
      "to": ".zcode/skills/architecture"
    },
    {
      "from": "skills/handoff",
      "to": ".zcode/skills/handoff"
    },
    {
      "from": "skills/diagnose",
      "to": ".zcode/skills/diagnose"
    },
    {
      "from": "skills/contour",
      "to": ".zcode/skills/contour"
    },
    {
      "from": "defaults",
      "to": ".zcode/defaults"
    },
    {
      "from": "package.json",
      "to": ".zcode/package.json"
    },
    {
      "from": "scripts",
      "to": ".zcode/scripts"
    },
    {
      "from": "hooks",
      "to": ".zcode/hooks"
    }
  ],
  "post_update": [
    {
      "run": "python3 .zcode/skills/kb-search/gitmark.py index",
      "if_exists": "docs"
    },
    {
      "say": "Managed-блок в AGENTS.md: запустите init-скилл плагина (идемпотентен) — создаст блок или мигрирует его формат; строки .gitignore доложит он же."
    },
    {
      "say": "Роли: проектный оверрайд — <repo>/.zcode/ontoship/roles.md; разрешение: .zcode/defaults/roles.md → ~/.zcode/ontoship/roles.md → <repo>/.zcode/ontoship/roles.md."
    },
    {
      "say": "SessionStart-хук свежести KB: код вендорится в .zcode/hooks/session-start.sh, но регистрация — данные проекта. Чтобы включить, добавьте в .zcode/config.json блок hooks: {\"enabled\": true, \"events\": {\"SessionStart\": [{\"hooks\": [{\"type\": \"command\", \"command\": \"bash \\\"${ZCODE_PROJECT_DIR}/.zcode/hooks/session-start.sh\\\"\", \"timeoutMs\": 60000, \"statusMessage\": \"свежесть индекса KB\"}]}]}}. Хук молчит вне KB-проектов и никогда не блокирует сессию; --rebuild перестраивает индекс тихо."
    }
  ]
}
